/T (The global HR and recruitment services market is expected to reach $893.9 billion by 2024, growing at 2.88% from 2023 due to increased digital adoption, remote work expansion, and demand for AI-powered tools in recruitment \(IBISWorld, 2024\). Additionally, the career counselling and professional services sector is forecasted to grow by $2,077.8 billion from 2023 to 2028 at a CAGR of 5.7% \(Technavio, 2024\).)
