<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (AWS's infrastructure is a key factor in managing and forecasting costs, acting as a Variable Cost that scales with user growth \(Fig\). Through features like Reserved Instances, which offer up to 75% cost savings on predictable workloads, and Spot Instances for additional savings on non-critical tasks, AWS helps to significantly reduce operating expenses \(Amazon Web Services, 2024\). These measures are crucial in enhancing Bubroo's gross margins and supporting its path to profitability.)
/E (AWS's infrastructure is a key factor in managing and forecasting costs, acting as a Variable Cost that scales with user growth \(Fig\). Through features like Reserved Instances, which offer up to 75% cost savings on predictable workloads, and Spot Instances for additional savings on non-critical tasks, AWS helps to significantly reduce operating expenses \(Amazon Web Services, 2024\). These measures are crucial in enhancing Bubroo's gross margins and supporting its path to profitability.)
