/T (Revenue Streams  Individual User Subscriptions and Mentorship Fees Bubroo offers two subscription options: Basic Subscription \($8/month\): Users can message mentors without restrictions, access up to 10 daily mentor recommendations, and use AI-powered resume tools. Deluxe Subscription \($15/month\): Includes all Basic features, plus discounts on mentor sessions and unlimited mentor access. Mentorship interactions incur a $1 service fee per session, split between mentor and user. This generates consistent revenue from mentorship activity.)
